headers {
  Accept: application/json
}

docs {
  # Restful-Booker API Test Suite

  Automated API tests for the Restful-Booker hotel booking API
  (https://restful-booker.herokuapp.com), organised into two suites:

  - Positive API Testing: an end-to-end booking lifecycle (create, read,
    update, partial update, delete, verify deletion) with request chaining
    via runtime variables.
  - Negative API Testing: invalid payloads, malformed JSON, bad credentials
    and unauthorised mutations.

  Configuration such as the base URL and auth credentials lives in the
  Restful-Booker environment (environments/Restful-Booker.bru). Runtime
  variables (bookingId, token, negativeBookingId) are set dynamically by
  post-response scripts, so requests within a suite must run in sequence.
}
